# g / lan2 OpenWrt WireGuard reference.
# The reference deployment uses /etc/init.d/overlap-vpn and /usr/sbin/overlap-vpn
# because netifd was not restarted after installing wireguard-tools.

Reference interface:
        wg0 = 10.90.0.3/24, MTU 1420
        VPS peer = 10.90.0.1/32, 10.91.0.0/24, 10.93.0.0/24

# Site-specific values to fill in locally:
# - LAN: br-lan / 192.0.2.1/24
# - WAN: <COMPANY_UPLINK_DEVICE> / <COMPANY_UPLINK_IP/CIDR>
# - WAN gateway: <COMPANY_UPLINK_GATEWAY>
# - fw4/nftables is installed; WireGuard userland support is not yet present.
